# IMPL-WININFO_FILTER essence pseudocode

// [IMPL-WININFO_FILTER] [ARCH-WININFO_MACOS_COREGRAPHICS] [REQ-WININFO_OPEN_WINDOWS]
// Filter enumerated windows to application-layer defaults and sort for stable output.
PROCEDURE APPLY_LAYER_FILTER
  PRE: windows is non-nil slice from Lister
  INPUT: windows []Window, all_layers boolean (default false)
  CONTROL: IF all_layers THEN return all windows
           ELSE return windows WHERE layer == 0
  POST: every returned window has layer 0 when all_layers is false
  EFFECTS: filtered slice (may be empty)

// [IMPL-WININFO_FILTER] [REQ-WININFO_OPEN_WINDOWS]
PROCEDURE SORT_WINDOWS
  PRE: windows slice may be empty
  INPUT: windows []Window
  POST: sorted by App asc, Title asc, ID asc
  EFFECTS: stable sort order for table and JSON output
